    "section": "04. Making Attacks",
    "ruleNumber": "04.02",
    "summary": "Targets are picked for each selected weapon:\n\n- Shooting: exactly 1 enemy unit per weapon; unless stated otherwise it must be **visible** (06.01) to the model with the weapon, within the weapon's range and **unengaged**.\n- Fighting: 1 or more enemy units per weapon, each **engaged** with the model with the weapon, up to the weapon's A characteristic.",
